<PermissionSet xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <label>Support Agent</label>
    <description>Grants the support team everything they need on Support Requests and read-only context on Orders and Deflection Articles. Order data is intentionally read-only and lifetime value is read-only so agents can act on priority without editing commercial data - the field-level access story Tom (IT) asked about during discovery. Also grants Apex class access used by the routing and warranty layers.</description>
